     "id": 1171716,
     "content_html": "the Philippine Islands were liberated from Japanese control"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171717,
     "content_html": "Filipino rebels and the American military defeated the Spanish"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171715,
     "content_html": "rebel leader Emilio Aguinaldo sought asylum in Spain"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171714,
     "content_html": "a brutal guerilla war led to Spain’s paying $20 million for the Philippines"
    }
